## 📋 SECCIÓN 03: Feedback y Revisión

### Code Review Style

| Tipo Diff | Reviewer |
|-----------|----------|
| ≥50 líneas | adversarial-reviewer |
| Auth/payments | security-reviewer |
| API routes | api-contract-reviewer |
| Tests | testing-reviewer |

### PR Feedback

- Responder thread por thread
- Validar feedback antes de fix
- Si no válido, explicar por qué

